# FXStreet probe — Telegram notifications (OPTIONAL)
# Without this file the probe runs normally and simply sends nothing.
#
# 1. Create a bot: talk to @BotFather, send /newbot, copy the token here.
# 2. Get your chat id: send your bot any message, then open this in a browser
#      https://api.telegram.org/bot<YOUR_TOKEN>/getUpdates
#    and read  "chat":{"id":123456789}.  For a group/channel, add the bot to
#    it first — channel/group ids are negative numbers.
# 3. Save this file as ".env" (same folder as probe.py). It is gitignored.
#    NEVER commit or paste the real .env anywhere.

FXS_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=123456789:AAxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
FXS_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=123456789
